<title>UK: Peel Holdings H1 pretax rises 10.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Peel Holdings H1 pretax rises 10.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		3.54		   vs 3.60</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.5		    vs 2.0</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    5.46		   vs 4.94</p>
<p> Turnover		   33.46		  vs 32.22</p>
<p>NOTE - Peel Holdings Plc is a property and industrial development group.</p>
